@startuml 5.6_activity-diagram-checkin-noshow_Arzum
' 5.6 UML Activity diagram (swimlanes) - QR Check-in and No-Show (F5, F6, UC-05, UC-09) - CampusSlot
' Owner: Arzum (UX/UI Designer). Sources: project card (R7, R8, R9), 5.4 (FR-31 to FR-43),
'          5.8.4.8 check-in logic, 5.8.4.9 scheduler jobs J1 and J2, 5.7 state machine (T8 to T10).
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -Playout=smetana -tpng <this file>
title CampusSlot - UML Activity Diagram: QR Check-in and No-Show (R7-R9)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #1F5FBF
skinparam ArrowColor #1F5FBF

|Campus User|
start
:Go to the resource with a\nCONFIRMED reservation;
:Scan the QR code, or type the\n6-digit code if the camera does not open (E11);

|System|
:Find the resource by its QR token\nor its 6-digit code;
if (Resource found?) then (yes)
  if (R7: the user has a CONFIRMED reservation on it and\nstart - 10 min <= now <= start + 15 min?) then (yes)
    :Create the check-in (time and method)\nand set CHECKED_IN;
    |Campus User|
    :See "Checked in" and use the resource;
    |System Scheduler|
    :J2: when the end time has passed,\nset COMPLETED;
    stop
  else (no)
    |System|
    :Refuse and say why (FR-37):\ntoo early, too late, already checked in,\nnot confirmed, or no reservation here;
    |Campus User|
    :Read the reason;
  endif
else (no)
  |System|
  :Refuse: check-in code not valid;
  |Campus User|
  :Read the reason;
endif

|System Scheduler|
if (R8: CONFIRMED and no check-in\n15 minutes after the start?) then (yes)
  :Set NO_SHOW and free the resource;
  note right
    The scheduler runs every 60 seconds (J1).
    It looks at every CONFIRMED reservation that
    has no check-in, whatever the user did before.
  end note
  :Notify the user (NO_SHOW_RECORDED);
  if (R9: 3 or more NO_SHOW in the last 30 days\nand no running penalty?) then (yes)
    :Create a 7-day Penalty;
    :Notify the user (PENALTY_APPLIED);
    |Campus User|
    :Cannot reserve until the penalty ends (R4);
  else (no)
  endif
else (no)
endif
stop

@enduml
